  "keyFeatures": [
    "Multi-agent architecture with four specialized trading sub-agents (Scalper T1, Momentum T2, MacroTrader, Speculative T3)",
    "EMA Crossover strategy with configurable fast/slow periods and anti-repainting protection",
    "Three trading modes: Trend (aggressive stop-loss), Target (hold to take-profit), and Scalper (micro-gains)",
    "Dynamic timeframe switching between active (1m) and passive (5m) market hours",
    "Full Telegram bot UI with inline keyboards, per-agent controls, and manual order execution",
    "Comprehensive risk management: max positions, capital exposure, daily loss limit, trailing stop, micro-DCA, and time-based stop",
    "Paper trading mode with isolated digital wallet and precise P&L accounting",
    "Automatic profit harvesting and CLP (Chilean Peso) currency conversion",
    "SQLite database for candle history collection, trade records, and decision logs",
    "Asynchronous engine built on asyncio, CCXT, APScheduler, and python-telegram-bot"
  ],
